text=Use this settings window to enable additional action bars on screen. The action bar to be displayed can only be edited here.<br><br>Three action bars can be accessed by default on free worlds, six on members. You may purchase additional action bars via Solomon's General Store.<br><br>You may display up to five action bars on screen at the same time.
textshadow=yes
colour=0x7592a0
onload=script10496(event_com, event_comsubid, 0x00000c)

